{
 "id": "seg1",
 "title": "换个名字再来",
 "pill": 1,
 "total": 63.44,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg1-00",
   "text": "2016 年 6 月，以太坊上的 The DAO 被攻击，损失约 6000 万美元。",
   "spoken": "2016 年 6 月，以太坊上的 The DAO 被攻击，损失约 6000 万美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg1-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 5.52,
   "speechStart": 1.6,
   "speechEnd": 6.919
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-01",
   "text": "根因只有一句，先转账，后更新余额。",
   "spoken": "根因只有一句，先转账，后更新余额。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg1-01.wav",
   "start": 7.34,
   "dur": 3.84,
   "speechStart": 7.439,
   "speechEnd": 11.013
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-02",
   "text": "钱已经转出去，账上的余额还没减。",
   "spoken": "钱已经转出去，账上的余额还没减。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg1-02.wav",
   "start": 11.4,
   "dur": 3.12,
   "speechStart": 11.494,
   "speechEnd": 14.351
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-03",
   "text": "对方合约在收款的回调里，马上回来，再取一次。",
   "spoken": "对方合约在收款的回掉里，马上回来，再取一次。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg1-03.wav",
   "start": 14.74,
   "dur": 3.84,
   "speechStart": 14.74,
   "speechEnd": 18.39
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-04",
   "text": "七年后，2023 年 7 月，Curve 被攻击，损失约 7000 万美元。",
   "spoken": "七年后，2023 年 7 月，Curve 被攻击，损失约 7000 万美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg1-04.wav",
   "start": 18.8,
   "dur": 5.6,
   "speechStart": 18.8,
   "speechEnd": 24.196
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-05",
   "text": "这一次，合约里写了重入锁。",
   "spoken": "这一次，合约里写了虫入锁。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg1-05.wav",
   "start": 24.62,
   "dur": 3.84,
   "speechStart": 24.718,
   "speechEnd": 28.217
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-06",
   "text": "可是 Vyper 编译器，把这把锁实现错了。",
   "spoken": "可是 Vyper 编译器，把这把锁实现错了。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg1-06.wav",
   "start": 28.68,
   "dur": 2.8,
   "speechStart": 28.68,
   "speechEnd": 31.291
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-07",
   "text": "又过了一年多，2024 年 9 月，Penpie 损失约 2700 万美元。",
   "spoken": "又过了一年多，2024 年 9 月，Penpie 损失约 2700 万美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg1-07.wav",
   "start": 31.7,
   "dur": 6.24,
   "speechStart": 31.791,
   "speechEnd": 37.751
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-08",
   "text": "它的领奖函数，没有加锁。",
   "spoken": "它的领奖函数，没有加锁。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg1-08.wav",
   "start": 38.16,
   "dur": 2.64,
   "speechStart": 38.16,
   "speechEnd": 40.566
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-09",
   "text": "三个名字，三种写法，其实是同一个错误，先交互，后记账。",
   "spoken": "三个名字，三种写法，其实是同一个错误，先交互，后记账。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg1-09.wav",
   "start": 41.02,
   "dur": 6.96,
   "speechStart": 41.02,
   "speechEnd": 47.744
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-10",
   "text": "一个早就修过的漏洞，为什么会换个名字，一再回来？",
   "spoken": "一个早就修过的漏洞，为什么会换个名字，一再回来？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg1-10.wav",
   "start": 48.2,
   "dur": 5.2,
   "speechStart": 48.2,
   "speechEnd": 53.19
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-11",
   "text": "读旧事故，能不能让我们提前认出下一起？",
   "spoken": "读旧事故，能不能让我们提前认出下一起？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg1-11.wav",
   "start": 53.9,
   "dur": 3.84,
   "speechStart": 53.999,
   "speechEnd": 57.534
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-12",
   "text": "带着这两个问题，我们走进一座事故档案馆。",
   "spoken": "带着这两个问题，我们走进一座事故档案馆。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg1-12.wav",
